r>\n<h2 id=\"响应式与状态\">响应式与状态</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 响应式 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div class=&quot;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 悬停状态 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;button class=&quot;bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 active:bg-blue-700&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- 暗色模式 --&gt;&#10;    &lt;div class=&quot;bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;!-- 聚焦状态 --&gt;&#10;      &lt;input class=&quot;border focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;!-- 分组悬停 --&gt;&#10;      &lt;div class=&quot;group&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;span class=&quot;group-hover:text-blue-500&quot;&gt;悬停父级时变色&lt;/span&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;!-- 同级状态 --&gt;&#10;      &lt;input class=&quot;peer&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;p class=&quot;hidden peer-invalid:block text-red-500&quot;&gt;验证失败&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 响应式 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- 悬停状态 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span