span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tailwind-v4-新特性\">Tailwind v4 新特性</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* Tailwind v4 使用 CSS-first 配置 */&#10;@import &#39;tailwindcss&#39;;&#10;&#10;@theme {&#10;  --color-brand-500: #3b82f6;&#10;  --font-sans: &#39;Inter&#39;, sans-serif;&#10;  --spacing-18: 4.5rem;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* Tailwind v4 使用 CSS-first 配置 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tailwindcss'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@theme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --color-brand-500: </span><span style=\"color:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">#3b82f6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --font-sans: 'Inter', </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sans-serif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --spacing-18: 4.5rem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>v3</th>\n<th>v4</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tailwind.config.ts</code></td>\n<td>CSS <code>@theme</code> 指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostCSS 插件</td>\n<td>原生 CSS 引擎（Lightning CSS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PurgeCSS</td>\n<td>内置按需生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JIT 模式</td>\n<td>默认（唯一模式）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Utility-First</strong> 用细粒度工具类替代语义化 CSS 类，减少 CSS 增长</li>\n<li><strong>配置系统</strong>通过 <code>tailwind.config</code> 将设计令牌映射为工具类</li>\n<li><strong>插件系统</strong>支持自定义组件和工具类，扩展能力强</li>\n<li>与设计系统集成时，通过<strong>令牌驱动配置</strong>确保一致性</li>\n<li>抽象模式：用 <strong>React 组件</strong>封装工具类组合，而非 <code>@apply</code></li>\n<li><strong>Tailwind v4</strong> 转向 CSS-first 配置，性能大幅提升</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Tailwind 架构","id":"tailwind-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Utility-First 理念","id":"utility-first-理念"},{"level":3,"text":"传统方式 vs Tailwind 方式","id":"传统方式-vs-tailwind-方式"},{"level":2,"text":"配置定制","id":"配置定制"},{"level":3,"text":"tailwind.config.ts","id":"tailwind-config-ts"},{"level":2,"text":"插件系统","id":"插件系统"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义插件","id":"自定义插件"},{"level":3,"text":"常用官方插件","id":"常用官方插件"},{"level":2,"text":"设计系统集成","id":"设计系统集成"},{"level":3,"text":"令牌驱动配置","id":"令牌驱动配置"},{"level":3,"text":"组件抽象模式","id":"组件抽象模式"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式与状态","id":"响应式与状态"},{"level":2,"text":"Tailwind v4 新特性","id":"tailwind-v4-新特性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"组件样式策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/design-systems/component-s